 increase caused by larger request sizes or changed payload characteristics", "Timeout increase caused by scheduling or resource contention unrelated to the planner", "Timeout increase caused by random variance or measurement noise in the synthetic fixture"]}, {"type": "INFERENCE", "claim": "The correlation between concurrency increase and timeout increase does not establish causation because the comparison lacked identical load and provider-limit controls.", "assumptions": ["The two observations come from the same task family and workload class", "No other configuration changes occurred between the two runs", "Timeout counts are accurate and comparable"], "source_refs": [{"source_ref": "ss-message-v1:[\"synthetic:chatgpt\",\"chatgpt\",\"birch-heldout-124\",\"m2\",\"user\",\"dialogue\"]", "evidence_hash": "sha256:34889ce0d3eb0bf899e57ac947bc565f243f2483cd7bed7c0e788505c1dc9722"}], "uncertainty": "LOW"}, {"type": "UNKNOWN", "claim": "Whether the planner change is a causal factor for the timeout increase is currently unknown.", "source_refs": [{"source_ref": "ss-message-v1:[\"synthetic:chatgpt\",\"chatgpt\",\"birch-heldout-124\",\"m0\",\"user\",\"dialogue\"]", "evidence_hash": "sha256:2c4e1e386fb959a997e1b7c708a18492327d7859bd042adc4a2b84595f23ae76"}, {"source_ref": "ss-message-v1:[\"synthetic:chatgpt\",\"chatgpt\",\"birch-heldout-124\",\"m1\",\"assistant\",\"dialogue\"]", "evidence_hash": "sha256:5c3a0596ce8c4b088e2903dd2b8b5db396512e05ddf56cef65fd011bea76dc50"}, {"source_ref": "ss-message-v1:[\"synthetic:chatgpt\",\"chatgpt\",\"birch-heldout-124\",\"m2\",\"user\",\"dialogue\"]", "evidence_hash": "sha256:34889ce0d3eb0bf899e57ac947bc565f243f2483cd7bed7c0e788505c1dc9722"}], "why_unknown": "The evidence does not include an apples-to-apples comparison of the same load under different concurrency levels, and provider limits and request-size distributions were not measured.", "required_evidence": ["Controlled A/B experiment with identical load, request-size distribution, a